@startuml
title FestaLink — Sequência: criar e aprovar reserva com eventos

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #374151
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7280
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F7FB
  ParticipantBorderColor #4B5563
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FAFBFD
  ParticipantFontColor #111827
  ActorBorderColor #4B5563
  ActorBackgroundColor #FAFBFD
}

actor "Cliente\n(app cliente)" as Cli
participant "API REST\n(:3000)" as API
participant "Use Case\nCriarReserva" as UCC
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "RabbitMQEventPublisher" as Pub
queue "Exchange festalink.eventos\n+ Fila festalink.worker\n(RabbitMQ :5672)" as Fila
participant "RabbitMQEventConsumer\n(Worker :3001)" as Cons
participant "WebSocketNotifier\n(Worker :3001)" as WS
actor "Prestador\n(app prestador)" as Prest

== Criar reserva ==
Cli -> API : POST /reservas\n(JWT cliente)
API -> UCC : executar(...)
UCC -> DB : begin tx
UCC -> DB : checa funcionamento,\nbloqueios e ativas
UCC -> DB : INSERT reserva (pendente)
UCC -> DB : commit
UCC --> API : reserva persistida
API --> Cli : 201 Created
UCC ->> Pub : publicar(ReservaSolicitada)
Pub ->> Fila : publish reserva.solicitada\n(persistent)
Fila ->> Cons : consume + prefetch(1)
Cons -> WS : notificarPrestadorDoSalao
WS ->> Prest : push ReservaSolicitada
Cons ->> Fila : ack manual

== Aprovar reserva ==
Prest -> API : PATCH /reservas/:id/aprovar\n(JWT prestador)
API -> "Use Case\nAprovarReserva" as UCA : executar
UCA -> DB : UPDATE status=aprovada
UCA --> API : reserva atualizada
API --> Prest : 200 OK
UCA ->> Pub : publicar(ReservaAprovada)
Pub ->> Fila : publish reserva.aprovada\n(persistent)
Fila ->> Cons : consume
Cons -> WS : notificarPrestadorDoSalao
WS ->> Prest : push ReservaAprovada
Cons ->> Fila : ack manual

note over Pub, Fila
  A publicação acontece após o commit
  da transação. Mensagens são persistentes;
  se o worker estiver offline, ficam na
  fila e são entregues quando ele
  reconecta. Em caso de erro de
  processamento, o consumer faz nack
  com requeue.
end note

@enduml
